{"compact": {"ja_sv": "Utskottets förslag: att avslå motionsyrkandena (nuvarande ordning behålls).", "nej_sv": "Stöd för motförslaget: reservation 15 från S.", "avstar_sv": "Partiet markerar en egen linje som inte finns med i slutomröstningens två alternativ.", "ja_en": "The committee proposal: rejecting the motions (keeping things as they are).", "nej_en": "Backing the counter-proposal: reservation 15 by S.", "avstar_en": "The party marks a position of its own that is not one of the two final alternatives."}, "en": {"rubrik": "Museum Matters", "dok_titel": "Cultural Heritage", "forslag_text": "The Riksdag rejects the motions \n\n2024/25:153 by Per-Arne Håkansson (S), \n\n2024/25:1774 by Mats Berglund et al. (MP) requests 30-32, \n\n2024/25:1845 by Fredrik Olovsson et al. (S), \n\n2024/25:2272 by Mattias Eriksson Falk and Roger Hedlund (both SD), \n\n2024/25:2406 by Magnus Resare et al. (M), \n\n2024/25:2410 by Magnus Resare (M) and \n\n2024/25:3110 by Lawen Redar et al. (S) requests 41 and 44.", "notis": "The Riksdag said no to approximately 120 proposals concerning cultural heritage in motions from the ordinary motion period 2024. The proposals concern, among other things, cultural heritage protection, emergency preparedness and museum matters.\nThe Riksdag refers, among other things, to ongoing work and implemented measures.", "alternatives": ["The Riksdag rejects the motions \n\n2024/25:153 by Per-Arne Håkansson (S), \n\n2024/25:1774 by Mats Berglund et al. (MP) requests 30-32, \n\n2024/25:1845 by Fredrik Olovsson et al. (S), \n\n2024/25:2272 by Mattias Eriksson Falk and Roger Hedlund (both SD), \n\n2024/25:2406 by Magnus Resare et al. (M), \n\n2024/25:2410 by Magnus Resare (M) and \n\n2024/25:3110 by Lawen Redar et al. (S) requests 41 and 44.", "Reservation 15"]}, "votering_id": "DB6793A2-2D57-400A-A4B0-4D02FF97568C", "rm": "2024/25", "beteckning": "KrU5", "punkt": 11, "dok_id": "HC01KrU5", "datum": "2025-02-26", "utskott": "KrU", "rubrik": "Museifrågor", "dok_